    "intro": "George R. R. Martin builds most Westerosi names from real <a href=\"medieval-name-generator.html\">medieval</a> English ones with a letter changed: Eddard for Edward, Jaime for James, Petyr for Peter. Each region has its own flavour, Targaryens sound Valyrian, and bastards get a surname that tells you where they were born. This **Game of Thrones name generator** builds names for eight regions of Westeros, plus Valyrian and Free Folk names, as a noble with a new house, a bastard or a first name alone.",
    "sections": [
